527	    //    (r,s) into per-CTA slots (opt_reduce) → grid barrier → CTA0 owner-sums in

527	    //    (r,s) into per-CTA slots (opt_reduce) → grid barrier → CTA0 owner-sums in
528	    //    ascending index order → writes d back to the persisted slot + a broadcast
